# ── Dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# This project has no build step (React/Recharts/Babel come from a CDN), but
# parsecheck.cjs needs @babel/standalone installed somewhere.
node_modules/
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-store/

# ── Secrets and credentials ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# This repo is public (GitHub Pages serves index.html from it), so nothing in
# it may be secret. SYNC_TOKEN and FINNHUB_KEY live as encrypted Cloudflare
# Worker secrets, read via `env` in worker.js; the sync passphrase lives only
# in each device's localStorage, typed once in Settings. PROXY_URL is a plain
# public URL — it identifies the Worker, it doesn't authorize anything.
# If you ever need a local secret, put it in .dev.vars (ignored below).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets.json
credentials.json
.dev.vars
.wrangler/

# ── App data exports and backups ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Settings → Download writes allocation-backup-YYYY-MM-DD.json, which is a
# COMPLETE dump of the user's finances: salaries, bank balances, holdings,
# net worth, every logged transaction. Never commit one.
allocation-backup-*.json
*-backup-*.json
backup/
backups/
exports/
*.bak

# ── Local databases ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# ── Editor / OS noise ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# ── Local tool state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Machine-specific Claude Code permissions; the shared skills under
# .claude/skills/ are intentionally NOT ignored.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ── Scratch ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
sandbox/
sandbox*/
tmp/
*.log
# sandboxworker.cjs switches behaviour from these, and dumps the last AI
# request body for a leak scan. Local knobs and captured payloads, not source.
mode.txt
aimode.txt
lastaictx.json

# ── Deploy staging ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# `node stage.cjs` rebuilds this from the seven served files on every deploy.
# Build output, not source — the originals all live at the repo root.
site/
